Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.37,0:00:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  快说啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我知道的部分昨晚都告诉你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, I told you everything I knew last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.59,0:00:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡和钱德搞在一起了  又怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not that big a deal. So Monica and Chandler are doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然这么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I cannot believe you would say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  摩妮卡和钱德在"做爱"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry. Monica and Chandler are "making love."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦  我是说这是大事啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I mean, come on. This is a huge deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道细节  是谁先吻谁的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need more details. Who initiated the first kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟她在一起时浪漫吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is he romantic with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们相爱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are they in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.28,0:00:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我知道一件事  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! I know one thing. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在这张沙发上做过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They did it right there on the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.83,0:00:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第12集  钱德例行公事的假笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E12  The One With Chandler's Work Laugh
