Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.67,0:01:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.92,0:01:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ross. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿甘  请给我一个英式松饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gunther, could I have a scone, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想听好消息吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Want to hear some good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.18,0:01:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识的某人要结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Someone I know is getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼是最开心的场合  对了  那个人就是我的前妻  艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, weddings are happy occasions. Oh, by the by, it's my ex-wife, Emily!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.73,0:01:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的英式松饼  谢谢  阿甘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's your scone. Thanks, Gunther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.40,0:01:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么白痴英国点心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stupid British snack food!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.33,0:02:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是情绪管理课教的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did they teach you that in anger management class?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个办法  你就这么想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what might help deal with it? Think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和艾蜜莉已经过去了  你不能对过去的事生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You and Emily are in the past. You can't be mad about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还气我们跟法国买土地吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you still mad about, you know, the Louisiana Purchase?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人在气那个  没错  因为已经过去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think anybody's mad about that. Exactly! Because it's in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个  有人要吃吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anybody going to eat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们盛装参加公司宴会  是在庆祝什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at us all dressed up for the big office party! By the way, what are we celebrating?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞晚会剩了不少酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We had a lot of liquor left over from the Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好  这里没有我们的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think this is cool. Because none of our friends are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以公开  不必躲躲藏藏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can be a real couple. We don't have to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我可以这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I can do this. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我可以这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能那样  我们不能那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can't do that. We can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  宾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Bing! Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:03:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位美女是谁  怎么跟你在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa! Who's the pretty lady, and what the hell is she doing with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.34,0:03:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也这样问自己  这是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha-ha-ha! I ask myself that very question. This is Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我上司道格  道格  这是摩妮卡  幸会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My boss, Doug. This is Monica. Hi, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我老婆卡拉  很高兴认识你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi! This is my wife, Kara. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宾  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bing! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到公司找新法律顾问的消息了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you hear about the new law firm working for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  杜塔  片达  豪伊事务所\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, sir. Yeah, Dewey, Cheatem & Howe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走  我们去喝个痛快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, let's go drink our body weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was that? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.54,0:03:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才发出的声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That noise you just made?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的工作笑  你的工作笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that was my work laugh. Your work laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  想熬过这场派对  你也得编出一个来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}believe me, to survive this party, you're gonna have to come up with one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  看我的  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Check me out. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.59,0:03:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说 "30块钱  跟城里一样"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He says, "$30, Father. Same as in town." Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚公司的人都好喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, everybody at work loved you last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  而且他们因为你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? And they like me more...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而更喜欢我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...just because I was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你弥补了不少乔伊造成的伤害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}think you repaired a lot of the damage from when they met Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,道格还找我们打网球  他出了公司还没理过我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Doug wants us to play tennis. He's never talked to me outside of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了在脱衣舞夜总会那次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Except for that time when we bumped into each other at that strip club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脱衣舞教堂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Strip church.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去找支球拍  你不是有支\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, I'm gonna go try to find a racket. I thought you had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本来有  后来被乔伊拿去中央公园对着大石头打\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I used to, but then Joey thought it'd be fun to go to Central Park and hit rocks...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大石头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...at bigger rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.09,0:04:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你有网球拍吗  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach, do you have a tennis racket? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我借给乔伊  就没拿回来过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, um, I lent it to Joey and I've never gotten it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么来了  今天不是要盘点吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here? I thought you had to do inventory all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  但我决定午休久一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well I do, but I decided I'd take a long lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陪陪我的朋友摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and spend some time with my friend, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在都不谈心了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I feel like we don't talk anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么新变化\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is new with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变化不多  工作很顺利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not much. Um, work's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:05:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不必聊工作嘛  什么都可以聊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We don't have to talk about work. We could talk about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来聊感情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's talk about relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你最近怎样  没人追\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. What's going on with you? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我原本觉得银行有一个人很帅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I... There was this guy at the bank that I thought was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不觉得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, but I don't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真精彩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, that's, uh, juicy. Ahem, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  我确实很忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I actually do have a lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定没别的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're sure there's just not anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确定啊  你有什么事想说吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I'm sure. Is there something you want to talk to me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有也不告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If there was, I wouldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  然后呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, then what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:05:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待会才轮到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah-ah, you'll get your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  在干什么  没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs. What's going on? Hey. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待会再继续\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我熬了一整晚写信骂艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, I was up all night writing this really nasty letter to Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原本写得很好  现在沾满了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was perfect, and now it's all covered in...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以去看电影了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right! Everybody ready to go to the movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我不去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, actually, I think I'm gonna skip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不去  对  我要留下来看书\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? I'm gonna stay and read my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在只想静一静\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just want to be alone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Sure you don't want to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆汉克斯  梅格莱恩  写信什么的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tom Hanks, Meg Ryan. They get mail and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不去了  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's okay, Joe. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's go, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Game!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:07:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  你的搭档真是快狠准\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I gotta tell you, that partner of yours is a real tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们喝口水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll just get a little sip of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天很猛吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Am I on fire today or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那两只肉鸡已经烤好了  等着被切来吃了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Those birds are browned, basted and ready to be carved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动  网球名将\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, easy, Martina.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得下一场应该让他们赢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think we should let them win the next game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  你刚说的话我听不懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, I don't understand what you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们赢一场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let them win one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗  他们任我们宰割  你看他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you crazy? We own those two. Look at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他喘不过气来  她在吃药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He can't even breathe, and she's popping pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不给他们机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not giving them a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有球拍  不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They have rackets, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宾  我想打完这场就收了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Bing, I think we're gonna make this the last game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,了解  我求之不得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, sir. Put me out of my misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的没打过职业\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure you never played pro? Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托让他们赢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please let them win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我顶多只能把战斗力降到95%\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll take it down to 95 percent, but that's the best I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕  漏掉了  我来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oopsie! Missed it! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出界\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Long!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.50,0:08:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然让他们赢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you let them win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少你把不爽掩饰得很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, at least you hid your feelings well about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很沮丧  这是我的球拍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was frustrated. It was my racket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你让我沮丧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was frustrated with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.51,0:08:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没输那场球  他们也不会找我们去吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If we hadn't lost, they would never have invited us to dinner tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.35,0:08:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最困扰的是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What bothers me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在他们身边整个人都变了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is how different you act around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,故意输球  工作笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The throwing the tennis games, the fake laugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"回头见  宾"  "不回头就不见"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the "See you later, Bing!" "Not if I see you first, Doug!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:09:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你  我不喜欢"工作的钱德"  那家伙是个狗腿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I gotta tell you, I don't like "work Chandler." The guy's a suck-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你这些话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? Because you said that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我晚上不跟你玩了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm not putting out tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对有问题  我哥从来不彻夜不归\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm telling you,Something's wrong. My brother does not stay out all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许应该去看看垃圾槽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe we should check the trash chute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯挤不进垃圾槽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross couldn't fit down the trash chute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  就差那么一点点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. He almost could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.85,0:09:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我之前卡住过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which is exactly how I got stuck there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你死哪去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是去外面了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just, you know, out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外面  天哪  我们怎么没去那里找\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, out! God, I don't know why we didn't think to check there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我先去喝酒  然后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I, uh, went to a bar and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就晃了一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I just, uh, walked around for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你整夜一个人在外面乱晃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You walked around all night in the city by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他嘿咻了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He hooked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.05,0:10:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟某人嘿咻了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He hooked up with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不必回答你们的问题  我是个大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't have to answer your questions. Okay? I'm a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱怎样就怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他嘿咻了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He hooked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,聊聊她嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell us about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你把围巾掉在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, you left your scarf...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我知道你们在想什么  但钱德在也门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know what you all are thinking, but Chandler is in Yemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还年轻  我有需求  我不能等一辈子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a young woman. I have needs. I can't wait forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是这么想的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, no, that's what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.52,0:10:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我求求你们  在批评我之前先想一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I'm asking you, please just take a moment before you judge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人在批评你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, nobody's judging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你  天时地利人和先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you, Mr. Right-place-at-the-right-time...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.49,0:11:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我联络\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们要说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look, I know what you guys are going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.21,0:11:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的孩子会毛茸茸的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You two would have very hairy children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.59,0:11:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你会说那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't know you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  珍妮丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross! Janice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Hold on, hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is Ross. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我们的朋友  他显然是疯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's our friend. He obviously went crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.23,0:11:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脑筋秀逗了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He obviously lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没那么夸张  好吗  珍妮丝和我有很多共同点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't lose my mind, okay? Janice and I have a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都离过婚  我们都有小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've both been divorced. We both have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的要再见她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you actually going to see her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别影响他  我确实要再见她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't put ideas in his head! I am gonna see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看啦  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it, Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.79,0:11:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说出一件我没坦承过的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I have to tell you something that I have never admitted during our entire friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:12:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高中时我知道你喜欢詹姆法洛  但我还是跟他上了床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, when we were in high school I made out with James Farrell even when I knew that you liked him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  说出来的感觉真好  好  该你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow! That feels so good to get off my chest. Okay, you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.35,0:12:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该我了  什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My turn? What are you talking about? Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.35,0:12:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你和钱德的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know about you and Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我那天听到你们在讲电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I overheard you on the phone the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说 "我会告诉瑞秋  我要花两个小时洗衣服"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You said, "I'll tell Rachel I'm doing laundry for a couple of hours."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说 "洗衣服  那是我的新绰号吗"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And he said, "Laundry? Is that my new nickname?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.95,0:12:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你说 "不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you said, "No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明知你的绰号是大鹏"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what your nickname is, Mr. Big."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, heh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你正在写剧本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sounds like you're writing yourself a little play there, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得把结局告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I... Let me know how that one turns out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  因为我吓到了  把电话挂掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wouldn't know because I got so freaked out I hung up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你听完\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if you had kept listening, ha-ha-ha...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会听到  我是叫他大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you would have heard me call him Mister Big...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,碉堡  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...ot. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:12:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大碉堡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Bigot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他喜欢讲碉堡的笑话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. He tells the most racist jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  所以就这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说你和钱德之间没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're telling me there's nothing going on between you and Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me and Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿出20元来  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Put your $20 down. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先找到零食的赢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}First one to find the tasty treat wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.13,0:13:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? All right. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请参赛者从休息室出场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's get the contestants out of their isolation booths.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们出场了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And they're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别挡住我的参赛者  栽判\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa.Get your foot off my contestant! Judge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,栽判判定没有违规\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Judge rules no violation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说也奇怪  我今天跟珍妮丝过得很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's so weird to say this, but I just had a great date with Janice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  真的假的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我跟她诉说近来的惨事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I opened up to her about all the terrible stuff that's been happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了好几个小时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I talked for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人专心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:14:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听你倾诉的感觉真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to have someone give you such focused attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你何必找她  你有我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't need Janice for that. You've got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸭子找到花生酱饼干了  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the duck gets the Nutter Butter! No! Agh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是花生酱饼干  那是一颗馄饨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not a Nutter Butter. That's an old won ton!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,裁判判定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Judge rules...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.39,0:14:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是花生酱饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Nutter Butter. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真难判  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tough call. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  我们应该支持克林顿总统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seriously, I strongly believe that we should all support President Clinton...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和她的老公比尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and her husband, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的咖啡要怎么上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how do you like your coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要  谢谢  我要点点糖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}None for me. Just a little bit of sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就让摩妮卡把指头伸进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe I'll bring it out and have Monica stick her finger in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该就会甜了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That ought to sweeten it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那样笑怎么不会头痛  久了就习惯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How does that laugh not give you a headache? You get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不觉得我会习惯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think that I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以后就不甩这套了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So if you don't mind, maybe this will be it for me on the work things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老板说笑我就笑  这又有什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I laugh at my boss's jokes. What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能跟我尊敬的男友在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd rather hang out with a sniveling work weasel guy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我干嘛陪一个没尊严的马屁精\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...when I could be hanging out  with my boyfriend, who I actually respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得为卡拉煮的咖啡道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, heh.I gotta apologize for Kara's coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果它去打架\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd feel sorry for it if it got in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连自己都保护不了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not strong enough to defend itself. Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到我的话了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you hear what I said Bing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.91,0:15:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个笑话啊  你是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a joke, Bing. What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得不好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I just didn't think it was funny, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I just... Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.76,0:15:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你没听懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just don't think you understood the joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.89,0:15:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好笑嘛  你一定是没听懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it was really funny. I just don't think that you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡拉煮的咖啡很稀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh, you see, Kara's coffee is weak-tasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但道格是在暗示它很虚弱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But what Doug did was imply that it was weak physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你懂了吗  我懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You get it now, honey? I think I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  莫尼卡  我觉得你需要解释\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, Monica. I thought you could use the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咖啡打架\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Coffee in a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以在这里看漫画吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mind if I read my comic books in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德和摩妮卡在一起  我很难专心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler and Monica are over there. It's kind of hard to concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  她刚打来说她要加班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? She just called and said she was going to be working late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一直骗我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She keeps lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  我现在就过去  揭穿他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it! I'm gonna go over there and I'm confronting them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我得讲碉堡的笑话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you're telling me that I have to tell racist jokes now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我不太会圆谎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just not very good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很不会骗人  我又很讨厌骗瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a terrible liar. I hate having to lie to Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们还不能公开  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But we're not ready to tell yet. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是从高中起  我什么事都告诉瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ever since high school, Rachel was the one person that I told everything to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:16:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好怀念那种感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I miss that so much now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我最要好的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  瑞秋  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, Rachel! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么跑来这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛  我是来借这盏灯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I actually came over here to borrow this lamp...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好看书\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to, um, look at my books.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看得清楚一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, see them a little better. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, great. Great. Um... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在钱德的房间里是因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what I was doing in Chandler's room is that, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在帮忙打扫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I was cleaning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  是他付钱请我打扫  是喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, he pays me to clean it. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个赚零用钱的好办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What a great way to make some extra pocket money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前我说要加班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I said to you earlier that I was at work, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.23,0:17:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是指我的这个新工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm at my new work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不错  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good enough. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.11,0:17:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去看书了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go look at my books.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我得去忙我的新工作了  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Go get back to my new job. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.96,0:18:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你找到这份工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Congratulations on your new job!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.35,0:18:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  她可真好骗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, she is really gullible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.69,0:18:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的咖啡  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here you go. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.06,0:18:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我该走了  你确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I should get going. You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想留多晚我都奉陪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can stay out as late as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过我为什么休长假吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told you I'm on sabbatical from work...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.57,0:18:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你说过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes. You did. Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的  又怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man! What is wrong now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是点这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't what I ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的人生就不能顺利一点吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man! Can't anything go right in my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先是我的婚姻破裂  然后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}First, my marriage falls apart, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:18:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:19:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你被赶出你家  工作没了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You lose your apartment, then you lose your job...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的前妻很快就再婚了  现在咖啡又错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then your ex-wife gets married so fast! And now the coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we need to talk. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时我觉得  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sometimes I feel... No, no, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我要说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的美好时光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that the sun has set...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经落日了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...on our day in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.99,0:19:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你是个很好的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You're a very sweet person, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unfortunately...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没办法再听到你继续哀下去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I just don't think I can take another second of you whining!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你确认一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me make sure I'm hearing this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要跟我结束  因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're ending this with me because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我太会发牢骚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm too whiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.31,0:19:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you're saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:20:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是这么的爱发牢骚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I've become so whiny...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我让你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珍妮丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...annoy you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,觉得很烦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Janice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不要紧吧  现在不要紧了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you gonna be okay? I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经两人出局了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess, that's two out of three...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, we gotta talk. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.91,0:20:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想趁你听说之前告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to tell you something before you heard it from someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望不会太奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hope this isn't too weird but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:20:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最近跟珍妮丝交往过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I had a thing with Janice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我干嘛生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would I be mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.85,0:21:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这种事有它的道义在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because there's certain rules about this kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.27,0:21:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能追朋友的旧情人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't, uh... You don't fool around with your friends' ex-girlfriends...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.19,0:21:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心上人  或是有亲属关系的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...possible girlfriends or girls they're related to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你知道吗  我要原谅你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you know what I'm gonna do? I'm gonna forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为那样才叫兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because that's what friends do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会原谅朋友  犯了你念的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They forgive their friends when they do everything you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那串禁忌  谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All the things on the list there. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我要你记住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I want you to remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我原谅了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that I forgave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我还要你记住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I also want you to remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.05,0:21:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我免费收留你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that I let you live here rent-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.47,0:21:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我还要你记住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. And I want you to remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我送你27块钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that I gave you 27 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:22:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无条件奉送\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No strings attached!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.31,0:22:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你记不住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you can't remember that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该写  我们写下来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I think we should write it down. Let's write it down!
